  "section": "6.50",
  "rulesText": "Ability: Dexterity\n\nWeight: 5 lb.\n\nUtilize: Mend a tear in clothing (DC 10), or sew a Tiny design (DC 10)\n\nCraft: Padded Armor, Basket, Bedroll, Blanket, Fine Clothes, Net, Robe, Rope, Sack, String, Tent, Traveler's Clothes"
